 TeachHomeRelease: CancelJobsOnAxis + DecStop instead of golden StopAllMotor +
 every-axis 1203 stop; Motor Test DoHome: no EndSingleHome that dropped every
 axis's job untracked); STOP still stops everything; tests updated +
 two-axes-homing case. (2) Screen EMERGENCY STOP: WS panel.estop
 (token-exempt, also served inside blocking dialogs) = golden alarm stop
 (StopAllMotor(true); SoftStop=SoftStart=SystemStart=false) + every 1203 axis
 stopped / jobs ended (W906_MotorAccessOnAlarm) + a running full HOME aborted
 like the panel PAUSE; queued soft keys dropped; MainScanKey [13] -- EastSun
 1003

